coded>&lt;img src="https://www.91-cdn.com/metareel-images/content/Movie-poster-7-8608ef111a0919c81d71fc3bedb07b89f856342c.jpg?tr=h-350,w-230,q-60&amp;version=5" alt="Sumo Didi" style="max-width:300px;float:left;margin:0 10px 10px 0;border-radius:6px;" /&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:8px;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;91Mobiles OTT&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Language&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;Hindi&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Category&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;OTT Release&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Release Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;23 Oct 2026&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sumo Didi is a biographical sports drama that portrays the inspiring and challenging journey of Hetal Dave, who defied societal norms and pressures to become India's first and only professional female sumo wrestler. The film explores her struggle against stereotypes related to women's bodies and strength, her rigorous training in Japan, and her unwavering determination to make a mark in a sport unheard of&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.91mobiles.com/entertainment/sumo-didi-movie-224105</guid><enclosure url="https://www.91-cdn.com/metareel-images/content/Movie-poster-7-8608ef111a0919c81d71fc3bedb07b89f856342c.jpg?tr=h-350,w-230,q-60&amp;version=5" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:52:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[Hindi] [OTT Release] The Legend of Hanuman : Season 7</title><link>https://www.91mobiles.com/entertainment/the-legend-of-hanuman-season-7-series-149617</link><description>&lt;img src="https://www.91-cdn.com/metareel-images/content/Season-posters-7-1742545358.png?